<title>USA: Comprehensive Environmental unit gets deal.</title>
<headline>Comprehensive Environmental unit gets deal.</headline>
<dateline>WEST BABYLON, N.Y. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comprehensive Environmental Systems Inc said Wednesday that its Trade-Winds Environmental Restoration Inc subsidiary has been awarded a multi-phase asbestos abatement contract for about $7.2 million.</p>
<p>The company said the first phase, valued at $2.7 million, is to begin immediately.</p>
